 'The read-only evaluator forms the original token/zero-cue affine input,then adds αwC at every recurrent step. It uses detached frozen source tensors with h0=0 and the original7 teacher-forced inputs/targets. The stored third input column remains zero. A separate functional evaluator constructs a local hypothetical nonzero third column and validates equivalence without changing the trained tensor. Thus this is a frozen input-drive probe,not evidence that the unchanged native C channel acquired a retrieval policy. An isolated untrained column would be functionally equivalent only if exempt from the source zero-column enforcement.','',
 'Success means mean7-position CE≤.5 and accuracy≥6/7. Strong familiar requires both A/B to meet these separately. R is successes/20 contexts **within** a network. Context CE/accuracy/margins andmedianCE are first reduced within each trained seed,then20 paired seeds are bootstrapped10,000 times,RNG20260925. The inferential unit is20 trained seeds,not400 independent networks. CIs are pointwise descriptive.','',
